{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HAB","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"哈巴谷书","commonName":"哈巴谷书","title":"哈巴谷书","order":35,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"79e455564c8db5af84e1090faf367e2f580c93a71dbc68109fd4b0c698e35a0b","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HAB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HAB/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":56},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是哈巴谷先知得到的启示。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["哈巴谷的抱怨"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要向你呼救到何时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你才垂听呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暴虐横行，我向你呼求到何时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你才肯拯救？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你为何让我目睹罪恶？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你为何对邪恶坐视不理？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我眼前尽是毁灭和暴力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到处是纷争和冲突。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此律法失效，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正义不彰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恶人包围义人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正义被扭曲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华的答复"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：“你们环顾列国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仔细察看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必惊奇不已，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我要在你们的时代行一件事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使有人告诉你们，你们也不会相信。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使凶残、暴虐的迦勒底人兴起。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要席卷天下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"强占别人的家园。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们任意妄为，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"令人胆战心惊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"“他们的马比豹子还快，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"比夜间的豺狼还猛。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的骑兵从远方飞驰而来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如鹰扑食。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们残暴成性，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像狂风一样扑来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"抓获的俘虏多如尘沙。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们嘲笑君王，讥讽首领，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对一切坚城嗤之以鼻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"修筑高台将其攻取。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些罪人如狂风横扫而过，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们奉自己的力量为神明。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["哈巴谷再次抱怨"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的上帝，我的圣者啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你从亘古就存在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你永不消逝","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你派迦勒底人来审判；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"磐石啊，你立他们作施罚者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的眼目极为清洁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"见不得邪恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不能容忍罪恶。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你为何容忍奸恶之人呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恶人吞灭比他们公义的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你为何默然不语呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"你为何使人像海里的鱼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像没有首领的爬虫呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦勒底人用钩子钩住他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用渔网网住他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用拖网把他们聚在一起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并因此而欢喜快乐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦勒底人向渔网献祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向渔网烧香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们靠渔网而富裕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"食物充足。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道他们要无休止地撒网，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无情地毁灭列国吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"“你永不消逝”另有希伯来文抄本作“我们不会死”。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":12}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HAB/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HAB/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NAM/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}